	["The Summit's Blackthorne quests"] = "Summit'in Blackthorne görevleri",
	-- {npc:260674} Ve'han Talongrasp
	["A group stop: the Blackthorne camps north-east of the Summit hold elite Outrunners, Priests and a Courier (60) as often as the Cultists and Adepts, with {npc:260674} (60, elite) in the middle and Ghansurok (61, elite) on the ridge. Grouping up is encouraged, look for people to do it with. Skip these if you are alone."] = "Bir grup durağı: Summit'in kuzeydoğusundaki Blackthorne kamplarında Cultist ve Adept'ler kadar elit Outrunner, Priest ve bir Courier (60) var. Ortada {npc:260674} (60, elit), sırtta da Ghansurok (61, elit) duruyor. Grup kurman önerilir, birlikte yapacak kişiler ara. Yalnızsan bunları atla.",

